      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NO LAGGING (5) has an excellent record over this journey having never missed the placings in six starts, including four wins and two placings. Recorded a 4.5 lengths win (22.09) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Looks suited and should go close. ELITE ARNOTT (2) made light work of a wide draw last time with a scorching early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing second (22.38) at this track over 381m. Will give a great sight again. DOUBLE GRIP (1) ran below best last time finishing fourth (17.73) over 297m at Northam from Box 4. Has a strong record from box 1, including three wins. Has ability and is one of the better chances. BURNING KUNA (7) did the right thing for favourite backers last time and is in the mix again.",
